  "body": "Title and CCC are issued and ready to move in\r\n\r\nEffortless Sophistication | Elevated Views | Uncompromising Quality\r\n\r\nWelcome to 28 Stapleford Crescent—a brand-new, architecturally designed sanctuary created for those who demand executive quality, seamless indoor-outdoor living, and coastal convenience. Standing proudly in a quiet, sought-after Browns Bay pocket, this contemporary masterpiece combines bold exterior lines with warm, refined interior luxury.\r\n\r\nKey Features at a Glance\r\n\r\n• Architectural Excellence: Striking modern facade featuring stylish weatherboard and vertical dark accent cladding.\r\n\r\n• Gourmet Chef's Kitchen: Equipped with premium gas cooking, sleek stone waterfall countertops, ambient under-cabinet LED lighting, and a custom built-in bar with dedicated wine storage.\r\n\r\n• Unmatched Indoor/Outdoor Flow: Wide sliding glass doors expand the living area onto an expansive private timber deck—ideal for summer barbecues and alfresco dining.\r\n\r\n• Elevated Balcony Views: Unwind on the upper-level glass-balustrade deck showcasing panoramic suburban vistas and stunning sunset skies.\r\n\r\n• Master Sanctuary: Generously sized master suite featuring a private heat pump, direct deck access, and a spa-inspired ensuite.\r\n\r\n• Designer Bathrooms: Fully tiled floor-to-ceiling bathrooms complete with frameless glass showers, back-lit LED round mirrors, and high-end black tapware.\r\n\r\n• Versatile Garaging & Laundry: Fully carpeted internal-access garage featuring built-in laundry cabinetry and sink setup—perfect for extra utility or home workshop space.\r\n\r\n• Year-Round Comfort: High-spec heat pumps, double-glazed windows, plush carpeting, and light oak-toned flooring throughout.\r\n\r\nDesigned for Entertaining & Everyday Comfort\r\nFrom the moment you step inside, light-filled spaces and soaring high ceilings welcome you home. The lower floor centers around an open-plan kitchen and dining layout crafted for entertaining. Whether hosting dinner parties by the custom bar or enjoying morning coffee at the kitchen island, every detail has been thoughtfully considered.\r\n\r\nStep directly out onto the sprawling, low-maintenance timber deck flanked by high privacy fencing. It’s your private oasis to relax, entertain, or let children and pets play safely.\r\n\r\nRestful Retreats & Breathtaking Sunsets\r\nUpstairs, the home continues to impress with quiet bedroom retreats and elevated views. The master bedroom offers a tranquil getaway with direct connection to the outdoors and a luxurious, fully-tiled ensuite. Step out onto the upper glass balcony in the evening to take in picturesque views over Browns Bay as the sun sets over the hills.\r\n\r\nPrime Browns Bay Location\r\nEnjoy the best of North Shore coastal living. Located just minutes from vibrant Browns Bay Village, picturesque beaches, popular cafes, boutique shops, and top-tier local schools, 28 Stapleford Crescent blends peace and seclusion with total everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nExperience Modern Luxury Today\r\nProperties of this caliber in such a prime coastal location rarely stay on the market for long.\r\n\r\n• Open Homes: As advertised online or by private appointment.\r\n\r\n• Contact: Reach out today to schedule your private tour and make this dream home yours!",
